@startuml
actor Moderator
actor Lecturer
actor "Academic Decision Maker" as DecisionMaker
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Review Service" as Review
participant "Output Service" as Output
participant PostgreSQL as DB

Moderator -> UI: Record findings and submit recommendation
UI -> Review: Create findings and immutable submission
Review -> DB: Store findings, assessments and submission hash
DecisionMaker -> UI: Record changes-required decision
UI -> Review: POST cycle decision
Review -> Output: request_changes
Review -> DB: Create correction round
Lecturer -> UI: Respond to findings and save new output version
UI -> Output: Create immutable version
Lecturer -> UI: Resubmit corrections
UI -> Review: POST cycle resubmit
Review -> Output: submit_for_review
Review -> DB: Seal new pack and create new task round
@enduml
